AI Agent = Intelligent assistant (answers and performs a specific task)
Agentic AI = Intelligent employee (plans, decides, uses tools, and completes an entire workflow with minimal supervision)

This progression is how many production AI applications are built today: first create a reliable AI Agent, 
then extend it into an Agentic AI system as the application's complexity grows.

==========



| If your application...                   | Use          | Reason                                          |
| ---------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Answers questions                        | ✅ AI Agent   | Simple question-answering is sufficient.        |
| Searches a database                      | ✅ AI Agent   | Retrieves and presents information.             |
| Uses RAG to answer from PDFs             | ✅ AI Agent   | One retrieval step followed by a response.      |
| Uses one or two APIs                     | ✅ AI Agent   | Limited tool usage.                             |
| Needs to plan multiple steps             | ✅ Agentic AI | Can create and execute plans.                   |
| Uses multiple tools automatically        | ✅ Agentic AI | Coordinates tools without user intervention.    |
| Makes decisions autonomously             | ✅ Agentic AI | Chooses the next action based on results.       |
| Automates an end-to-end business process | ✅ Agentic AI | Handles complex workflows from start to finish. |


============

| Project                                                            | Recommended  |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------ |
| PDF Chatbot                                                        | ✅ AI Agent   |
| Restaurant Ordering Chatbot                                        | ✅ AI Agent   |
| Watch Shop Chatbot                                                 | ✅ AI Agent   |
