=========

Example: Your Bus Project
AI Agent
User:
Show AC Sleeper buses from Chennai to Madurai.

↓

AI searches CSV/database

↓

Returns bus list

This is an AI Agent because it performs a single task.

=========

Agentic AI
User:
Book the best AC Sleeper bus to Madurai tomorrow.

↓

Search buses

↓

Compare fares

↓

Check seat availability

↓

Recommend best option

↓

Book ticket

↓

Process payment

↓

Send WhatsApp confirmation

↓

Store booking history

This is Agentic AI because it plans and completes multiple tasks to achieve the user's goal.

